sentences.text:
11. Let the applicant- Mohammad Salauddin Khan @ Kartikeya be released on bail in Case Crime No. 47 of 2023, under Section 406, 420, 467, 468, 471 I.P.C., registered at Police Station Chowk,
District Lucknow, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to the following conditions: -
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
12.

